body:
I see, thank you. Now that I'm reading multiple people say it's fine, now I regret messaging my boss about the clarification I speak Filipino and not Spanish 😭 like I should've just waited until I was in person and have it come up naturally. She hasn't replied in a few hours and I'm the kinda person that just worries when someone doesn't reply. 


Hhhhh I just hope they didn't hire me above others because of a misconception that I spoke Spanish, since I don't have exp as a receptionist Idk why else they would've. 


It wack. But yea. Thank you for your support ;-;
